Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,別叫我爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.45,0:00:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你的老大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.25,0:00:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.58,0:00:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,已經早上囉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,快起床
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.12,0:00:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,她說想跟零一起吃早餐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦 快點起床吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,快起床
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.87,0:00:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,正中要害…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.15,0:00:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.33,0:00:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.25,0:00:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是她說想要吃的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.87,0:00:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,真拿她沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜歡嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.25,0:00:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,這兩個傢伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:01:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我要去找阿久
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.54,0:01:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,有工作?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.54,0:01:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不 是要找她的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.50,0:01:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你們在說什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.12,0:01:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,抱抱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.87,0:01:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我才吃到一半耶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.00,0:01:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.70,0:01:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,餵你吃香蕉喔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.95,0:01:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,香蕉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.66,0:01:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒 是香蕉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.87,0:01:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,來啊 拿得到嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.87,0:01:19.50,UP,,0,0,0,,吱吱…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.50,0:01:21.34,UP,,0,0,0,,香蕉…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.95,0:01:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好吃的香蕉喔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.20,0:01:24.83,UP,,0,0,0,,給我 人家想吃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.90,0:01:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你好像猴子喔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.79,0:01:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你說說看"香蕉蕉"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.05,0:01:29.58,UP,,0,0,0,,我想吃 香蕉蕉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.10,0:01:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,要送她回母親身邊啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.25,0:01:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我想吃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.41,0:01:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,吱吱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.45,0:01:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,當然啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.58,0:01:40.12,UP,,0,0,0,,香蕉蕉…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.32,0:01:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我們又不可能養小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.08,0:01:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟我們…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.25,0:01:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是不見容於社會的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.50,0:01:49.91,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,ねえ愛したいこれは真実？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.91,0:01:53.41,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,ただ愛されたいのは不誠実？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.41,0:01:55.62,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,もうどうすればいい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.62,0:01:57.95,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,どうすればいいのか
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.62,0:02:04.41,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,街はいつも通り今日も
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.41,0:02:08.08,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,惚れた腫れたで色めきたつ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.08,0:02:11.58,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,エキストラは家に帰るだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:15.08,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,不貞腐れてやしないさ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.08,0:02:18.82,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,そんな日々を切り裂くように
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.82,0:02:22.32,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,突然現れた君は
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.32,0:02:25.87,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,痺れるような笑顔で僕の
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.87,0:02:30.66,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,心を砕いて見せた
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.62,0:02:34.87,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,ねえ愛したいこれは真実？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.87,0:02:38.50,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,ただ愛されたいのは不誠実？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.50,0:02:40.79,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,もうどうすればいい
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.79,0:02:43.54,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,どうすればいいのか
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.54,0:02:45.66,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,って分からないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.66,0:02:49.37,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,その頭の中が分かんない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.37,0:02:52.91,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,でも愛想は良いとかずるいよ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.91,0:02:58.04,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,こうやってまた君のペースに飲まれてく
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.16,0:03:05.25,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,そうやってまたほら振り回されてる
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:15.79,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,そうやってまたほら振り回されてる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.50,0:01:49.91,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,吶 我想愛你 這是真的嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.91,0:01:53.41,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,只想被愛就不算誠實嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.41,0:01:55.62,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,到底該怎麼辦?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.62,0:01:57.95,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,怎麼辦才好呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.62,0:02:04.41,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,今天的城市依舊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.41,0:02:08.08,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,令人神魂顛倒 興奮不已
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.08,0:02:11.58,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,臨時演員只是回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:15.08,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,絕對不是在彆扭啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.08,0:02:18.82,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,彷彿劃破這樣的日子一般
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.82,0:02:22.32,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,突然出現的你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.32,0:02:25.87,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,帶著令人陶醉的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.87,0:02:30.66,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,讓我明白了心碎的滋味
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.62,0:02:34.87,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,吶 我想愛你 這是真的嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.87,0:02:38.50,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,只想被愛就不算誠實嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.50,0:02:40.79,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,到底該怎麼辦?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.79,0:02:43.54,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,怎麼辦才好呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.54,0:02:45.66,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,不知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.66,0:02:49.37,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,我不知道你在想什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.37,0:02:52.91,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,你卻如此惹人憐愛 真不公平
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.91,0:02:58.04,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,就這樣 我又被你拉走節奏了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.16,0:03:05.25,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,於是你看 我又被任意擺布
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:15.79,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,於是你看 我又被任意擺布
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.16,0:03:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,上次真不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.87,0:03:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那份工作…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,後來怎麼樣了?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.95,0:03:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你們沒必要知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.54,0:03:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.54,0:03:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,話說回來 這是你委託我查的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.54,0:03:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.82,0:03:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你要送過去嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.41,0:03:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,目標對象不是留下了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.62,0:03:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼娃娃的禮物嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.79,0:03:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,對…對啊 沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.20,0:03:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我…我有急事就先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.75,0:03:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝招待
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.07,0:04:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,#03 生活的調味料
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.70,0:04:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,找到美俐的媽媽在哪裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.91,0:04:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然可能算不上是稱職的母親
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.75,0:04:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,總比沒有父母來得好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.75,0:04:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,像我就不知道父母是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.58,0:04:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,走上偏差的路 才變現在這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.16,0:04:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,難得聽你說這種話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.37,0:04:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.37,0:04:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,給你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.87,0:04:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,給你丸子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.75,0:04:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,請收下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.45,0:04:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,吃下去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.83,0:04:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,哪能吃…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.83,0:04:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,吃下去嘛 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.50,0:04:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.40,0:04:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就說有外人時 別喊爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.15,0:04:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有別人在啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.29,0:04:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦 開動吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.25,0:04:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,開動
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.59,0:04:54.76,UP,,0,0,0,,石烤地瓜 地瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.59,0:04:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是賣烤地瓜的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.90,0:04:59.99,UP,,0,0,0,,好吃的地瓜…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.12,0:04:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 我無法抵抗那個笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.20,0:05:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,在她那個年紀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.66,0:05:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我幾乎沒留下歡笑的記憶呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.04,0:05:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我也沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.50,0:05:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,也是 你家的狀況好像滿棘手的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.66,0:05:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然我不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.12,0:05:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不會問的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.54,0:05:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不會說
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.20,0:05:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,吶 我要吃烤地瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.58,0:05:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,很燙 要小心喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.95,0:05:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我們終究…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.45,0:05:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不是這塊料啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.04,0:05:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,吃地瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.33,0:05:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,咦?我的份呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.25,0:05:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,沒你的份
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.00,0:05:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.83,0:05:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 我分一半給你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.70,0:05:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是個好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.65,0:05:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,誇張
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.75,0:06:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我去買一下飲料
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.33,0:06:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我要盪鞦韆
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.00,0:06:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,幫我推
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.75,0:06:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.16,0:06:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,小妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.62,0:06:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己一個人嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.04,0:06:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.66,0:06:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你是她的父親嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.58,0:06:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.58,0:06:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那是她的家人嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.12,0:06:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.75,0:06:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 怎麼了?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.04,0:06:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你是她的爸爸嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 是的 我是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.08,0:06:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,對吧 美俐?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.20,0:06:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好嘛 叫我一聲爸爸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.58,0:06:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.87,0:07:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你才剛說別在外面叫你爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.45,0:07:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是指現在啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.16,0:07:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,請問 你有聽到吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.25,0:07:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,她剛剛有叫我爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.20,0:07:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 算是吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.79,0:07:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.58,0:07:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,別害人家擔心喔 美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.04,0:07:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,歹勢啦 不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.20,0:07:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,遇上那種情況 可以叫我爸爸啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.83,0:07:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我知道了 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.33,0:07:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你也一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.50,0:07:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,剛才那種時候你要自稱是她爸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.70,0:07:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.66,0:07:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不然會惹出很多麻煩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.29,0:07:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,零也是爸爸嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.70,0:07:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.95,0:07:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,零爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.33,0:07:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,就說不是了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.33,0:07:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,零爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.95,0:07:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,別這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.45,0:07:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 快點睡覺吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.04,0:07:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不然的話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.58,0:07:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,會有鬼跑出來喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.62,0:07:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我想看鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.83,0:07:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我騙你的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.20,0:07:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不會有鬼跑出來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.79,0:07:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,快睡覺吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.79,0:07:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我想跟爸爸一起睡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.00,0:07:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我要關燈囉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.54,0:08:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,零在哪裡?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.04,0:08:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.16,0:08:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,找到零…了?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.91,0:08:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.37,0:08:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你為什麼睡在這裡?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.37,0:08:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,以防被人偷襲
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.41,0:08:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,偷襲?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,可怕的傢伙會跑來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.33,0:08:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是鬼嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.65,0:08:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐也要一起睡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.83,0:08:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不行…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.87,0:08:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,孤零零的很危險喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.33,0:08:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,萬一做惡夢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.08,0:08:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,尿床的話
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.54,0:08:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,會被一騎爸爸罵的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.04,0:09:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,可怕的東西快滾開
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.33,0:09:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.16,0:09:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐還是小嬰兒時 媽媽會用的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.95,0:09:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,讓人笑咪咪的魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.54,0:09:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.54,0:09:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,笑咪咪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.66,0:09:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不會笑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.33,0:09:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,這是我學到的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.79,0:09:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,這也是魔法?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.37,0:09:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,算是嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.75,0:09:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,笑咪咪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.16,0:09:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,笑咪咪…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.66,0:09:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,這傢伙就是她媽媽啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.12,0:09:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,要出門嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.45,0:09:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.45,0:09:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,想吃媽媽的漢堡排嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.58,0:09:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,想吃
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.87,0:09:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那我們去吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.66,0:09:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.83,0:10:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是超市
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.33,0:10:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼什麼超市
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.37,0:10:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那個讀作"批發"超市
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.04,0:10:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,"餃子"超市?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.00,0:10:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不是餃子 是批發
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.62,0:10:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐喜歡吃餃子喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.50,0:10:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,她沒在聽你說
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 這樣的日子就到今天為止
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.41,0:10:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,耳根可以清淨了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.75,0:10:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣真的好嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.66,0:10:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,啊?你是指什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.37,0:10:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,她跟我們在一起根本不會有好事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.00,0:10:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,只不過是回到各自的生活罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.79,0:10:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,演技真差
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.50,0:11:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,對了 我先去看看狀況
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.08,0:11:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,反正 我去一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,要吃漢堡排了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.00,0:11:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,對啊 乖乖等我喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.75,0:11:34.01,UP,,0,0,0,,（星塵小酒館）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.25,0:11:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是這裡嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.66,0:11:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,這首歌…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.70,0:11:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,吶 我好無聊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.50,0:11:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,盪鞦韆
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.83,0:12:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,人家想盪鞦韆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.29,0:12:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我想玩…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.33,0:12:06.12,UP,,0,0,0,,別踢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.29,0:12:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,"別說再見"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.58,0:12:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,"別說再見"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.04,0:12:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上才開店喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.16,0:12:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我有話想問你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.54,0:12:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你是誰啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.08,0:12:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,搞屁啊你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.00,0:12:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不是說過別亂接客了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.25,0:12:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.20,0:12:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,少在那邊推託
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.87,0:12:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,別這樣啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.33,0:12:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.66,0:12:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 住手啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.20,0:13:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,可…可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.37,0:13:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你也沒事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.66,0:13:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你對我的男人做了什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.83,0:13:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,坐下吧 我幫你處理傷口
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.41,0:13:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,零 幫我推
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.87,0:13:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,接下來玩那個
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.45,0:13:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,零也坐上來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.08,0:13:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.04,0:13:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,坐那邊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.12,0:13:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,像這樣玩 上上下下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.87,0:13:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.40,0:14:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,零 你看我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.00,0:14:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,有在看嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.25,0:14:08.87,UP,,0,0,0,,他是她爸爸嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.48,0:14:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好嘛 認真看我嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.00,0:14:11.20,UP,,0,0,0,,總該揮個手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.20,0:14:12.25,UP,,0,0,0,,看來疏於照顧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.83,0:14:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,零
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.70,0:14:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,真好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.87,0:14:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,明天還要陪我玩喔 零
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.83,0:14:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,一騎爸爸也一起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.16,0:14:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你為什麼要叫一騎爸爸呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.62,0:14:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸就是爸爸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.50,0:14:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,因為他幫助了美俐嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.25,0:14:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那你的親生爸爸呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.50,0:14:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸就是遇到困難時
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.95,0:14:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,願意幫你的人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.58,0:14:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,懂了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.45,0:14:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸…嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.04,0:15:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼不給牠致命一擊?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.75,0:15:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不殺死對方
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.45,0:15:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,就換你被殺
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.20,0:15:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,別讓我失望
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.45,0:15:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.54,0:15:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,別叫我爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.33,0:15:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你的老大
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.70,0:15:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,來抓我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.95,0:15:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,等等啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.29,0:15:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.37,0:15:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 到底找我有什麼事?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你有個女兒吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.04,0:15:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,天曉得呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.62,0:15:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,她說她想見媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.95,0:15:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你是他的手下嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.33,0:16:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,賠償金呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.08,0:16:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,應該有吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.16,0:16:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.62,0:16:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是暫時收留迷路的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.20,0:16:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.95,0:16:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.37,0:16:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,反正那孩子與我無關了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.83,0:16:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼會與你無關?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.62,0:16:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,她還說想吃你做的漢堡排呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.79,0:16:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那是超市賣的調理包好嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.41,0:16:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,三片一包 200圓
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.16,0:16:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,喜歡吃那種東西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.37,0:16:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,真是窮酸的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.50,0:16:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不曉得是像誰呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.12,0:16:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那你就做給她吃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.95,0:16:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟你是她媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.45,0:16:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你以為我想生她嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.95,0:16:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我被不負責任的男人騙了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.08,0:16:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,連分手費也沒付
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.08,0:16:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,就把我趕出門
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.25,0:16:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想再見到那孩子了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.45,0:16:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你這傢伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.04,0:16:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,每當那孩子一笑 我就想揍她
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.12,0:16:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,明明沒什麼好笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.83,0:16:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,她卻對著我笑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.58,0:17:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,都叫她別再笑了也不聽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,真令人火大
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.54,0:17:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子有什麼罪過?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.57,0:17:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你也一樣不負責任啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.79,0:17:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,跑來臭屁地說教嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.61,0:17:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子笑的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.04,0:17:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,父母應該會想盡全力守護才對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.45,0:17:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.86,0:17:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我每天餵她吃飯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.07,0:17:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,幫她穿衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.62,0:17:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,她毀了我的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.00,0:17:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,還要我守護她的笑容?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.04,0:17:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,這點程度的付出是母親的責任吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.16,0:17:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,為孩子辛勞
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.50,0:17:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,賭上自己的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.37,0:17:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不就是身為父母的幸福嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,嘴上冠冕堂皇的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.66,0:17:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,會讓家人陷入更大的不幸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.66,0:17:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你連隻小屁孩都沒養過
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.95,0:18:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,少在那邊說大話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.66,0:18:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,每個人都給我滾一邊去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.75,0:18:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,快點消失吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.87,0:18:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,所以呢 你叫什麼名字?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.12,0:18:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,海坂美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.04,0:18:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,今年四歲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.66,0:18:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你從哪邊來的?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.62,0:18:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那邊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.70,0:18:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,知道家裡地址嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.04,0:18:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.33,0:18:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,迷路了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.75,0:18:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,美俐知道怎麼回家
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.58,0:18:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,總之先收容她
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.25,0:18:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,帶她去派出所吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.91,0:18:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.37,0:18:59.16,UP,,0,0,0,,喂 乖乖聽話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.02,0:19:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.23,0:19:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我要回家
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.79,0:19:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,別胡鬧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.25,0:19:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,快跟我們走
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.75,0:19:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.16,0:19:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.91,0:19:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸就是遇到困難時
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.16,0:19:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,願意幫你的人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.33,0:19:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 放開我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.04,0:19:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你乖一點
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.04,0:19:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你要幹嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.25,0:19:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,放開那孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.00,0:19:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.12,0:19:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟她約好明天還要一起玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.37,0:19:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你是這孩子的監護人嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.16,0:19:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.70,0:19:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你認識她的父母?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.00,0:19:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不認識
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.33,0:19:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.70,0:19:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,她的爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.62,0:19:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,回家吧 美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.58,0:20:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好 零爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.83,0:20:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,回家吧 美俐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.58,0:20:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.62,0:20:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,一騎爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.95,0:20:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎回來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.29,0:20:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.08,0:20:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,零爸爸有陪我玩喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.41,0:20:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,人家叫你"零爸爸"呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.54,0:20:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,零爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.16,0:20:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你剛剛也有在偷笑吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.20,0:20:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,沒這回事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,所以呢 接下來怎麼辦?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.41,0:20:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,這個嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.25,0:20:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,買晚餐回家吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.04,0:21:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,三人份嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.50,0:21:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,三人份
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.37,0:21:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.29,0:21:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你的臉怎麼了?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.20,0:21:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟女人都有緣無分呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.33,0:21:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我想也是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.16,0:21:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是媽媽的漢堡排
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.91,0:21:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.83,0:21:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,多吃一點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.00,0:21:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.12,0:21:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,比一騎爸爸做的還好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.95,0:21:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 還不賴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.95,0:21:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,這兩個傢伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.58,0:21:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 就這樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.95,0:21:54.25,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,変わらない光景予想外の 毎日だけど
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.25,0:21:56.37,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,それがいいって
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.37,0:22:01.41,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,振り回されたり空回って
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.41,0:22:06.33,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,目まぐるしく愛おしい日を
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.33,0:22:08.62,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,眠れない夜にそっと
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.62,0:22:10.62,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,口ずさむ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.62,0:22:15.79,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,子守唄や呼吸に合わせた手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.79,0:22:18.29,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,ただただ一日でも
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.29,0:22:20.12,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,この日々が
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.12,0:22:25.62,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,長く長く長く長く続くように
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.62,0:22:30.50,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,裸足で駆ける君を追った
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.50,0:22:34.91,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,いつか僕を超えて Ah
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.91,0:22:39.58,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,明日はどんな一日だろうな
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.58,0:22:44.33,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,僕ら一緒に歩いてこうか
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.33,0:22:49.62,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,いつもここに帰る場所があって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.62,0:22:53.91,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,悲しみも照らすように
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.91,0:22:56.29,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,それでもいいか
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.29,0:22:58.70,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,それもありかな
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.70,0:23:03.70,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,僕らの愛を分かち合おうか
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.70,0:23:08.95,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,予想出来ない未来には希望を
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.95,0:23:13.33,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,いつまでも照らして
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.95,0:21:54.25,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,不變的風景 每天都出乎意料
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.25,0:21:56.37,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,但這樣也不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.37,0:22:01.41,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,被折騰一番 白忙一場
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.41,0:22:06.33,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,過著眼花撩亂 令人疼惜的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.33,0:22:08.62,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,在睡不著的夜裡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.62,0:22:10.62,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,輕輕哼唱著
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.62,0:22:15.79,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,手配合著搖籃曲和呼吸拍著
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.79,0:22:18.29,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,就算只有一天也好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.29,0:22:20.12,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,希望這樣的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.12,0:22:25.62,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,能夠持續長長久久
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.62,0:22:30.50,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,追逐著赤腳奔跑的你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.50,0:22:34.91,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,總有一天會超越我 Ah
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.91,0:22:39.58,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,明天會是怎樣的一天呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.58,0:22:44.33,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,我們會一起走下去嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.33,0:22:49.62,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,在這裡永遠有我的歸處
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.62,0:22:53.91,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,希望連同悲傷都照亮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.91,0:22:56.29,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,即便如此也可以嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.29,0:22:58.70,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,這樣可能嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.70,0:23:03.70,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,應該分享我們的愛嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.70,0:23:08.95,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,願在不可預知的未來裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.95,0:23:13.33,OPEDCN,,0,0,0,,永遠閃耀著希望
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.70,0:23:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 已經該睡覺囉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.83,0:23:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 陪我一起睡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.58,0:23:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,和零爸爸三人一起睡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.58,0:23:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.54,0:23:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 這樣睡不好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.50,0:23:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,欸 放開我啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.04,0:23:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.75,0:23:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,人家不要
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.83,0:23:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我們三個人要一起睡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.95,0:23:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,餃子超市…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.83,0:23:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,零 你稍微靠過去一點啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.95,0:23:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.54,0:23:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,睡著了嗎?
